SUMMARY (not part of the license)

The source is public so you can read it, learn from it, fork it on GitHub, and
contribute to it. What you may not do is publish it: no uploading this mod or a
modified version of it to CurseForge, Modrinth, or anywhere else, and no
distributing builds of it. If the author disappears for a year, the license
converts to MIT so the project can be continued by someone else.

The project, its name, and its branding belong to the author. Contributors keep
the copyright in the code they wrote and may reuse it in their own work, but
contributing does not give anyone the right to publish this mod or to pull
their code back out of it.


