1.3 "Canonical Repository" means https://github.com/Leclowndu93150/Thaumaturge
    or a successor repository designated by the Author.

1.4 "You" means any person or entity exercising the permissions in section 2.

1.5 "Publish" means to make the Software, a modified version of it, or a binary
    built from it, available to any third party, including uploading it to a mod
    distribution platform, hosting it for download, bundling it in a modpack, or
    sending it to another person.

1.6 "Project" means the Thaumaturge name, logo, mod id, and branding, the
    Software taken as a whole, including the selection and arrangement of its
    parts, and every part of the Software that is not a Contribution.

1.7 "Contribution" means code or other material written by a Contributor and
    merged into the Canonical Repository.

1.8 "Contributor" means a person, other than the Author, whose Contribution has
    been merged into the Canonical Repository.


2. PERMISSIONS

Subject to section 3, You may:

2.1 View, read, and study the Software.

2.2 Fork the Canonical Repository on GitHub, and create branches and pull
